    "implementation_delta": "Publish AccelerateTrustedComputingBase@1 as the Accelerate-owned hermetic trusted-computing-base inventory for the objective-to-release path. Actors, assets, trust boundaries, state owners, canonicalization, CIDs, events, leases, fences, unknown outcomes, confirmations, proof admission, dependencies, and builds are bounded as thirty-two named TCB components across in-TCB, conditional-TCB, and out-of-TCB classes. Pack CID bafkreih72d3nncekez43wmtlczq5mdtymzniluujypwybpgu3mtt7i4v2e, current-root CID bafkreihjdjarrlr24sperlq3zl4hjrksbol4b5saxquie3wpyi6xwsobwi, chain CID baguqeeraeuvfodvledfa4nvfuso6eyyytzk2acptcogzwzyarkdinpqcsdfq, objective CID baguqeeraynsn7tjr3iaggnreylzxo3akaooqwp5bf5oheaa6eubth2zwqeba, idea digest baguqeeracbayojdov4jmqiirx22pavrg6nabazcocru6y3scrdx5e54mw2zq, Python client CID baguqeerat346yf4k7kenbqlbtyejeilgxamna262z3axzjjatzm2hccehblq, MCP client CID baguqeerasdkirdryda7uoi5gchsyhuyvh6d2uremm45zpob7hoss3ao66ahq, parity CID baguqeera6y3w7bhzy6hpo6ohfsrj5xihrw5vk6qqljjonjrupijd2yrp3hnq, PCPR-083 bypass proof CID baguqeeraepx7iiqcc4gtfp63kpozlkdd2qg3px3ptnqhj3rpigqtemjc5psa, and PCPR-090 threat-model CID baguqeera2kz3zj4stztmb22lmbcuyj3zj2ekdg7st2qzefbr5z6r6vemnhxq are bound and not reminted. Replaying the same TCB-inventory command yields inventory CID baguqeeral3tjeriuspe3e3qe25eqssmer6fekhmmq3v7htpkr2rjjiqatrcq and is rejected as a duplicate effect. DatasetsTrustedComputingBaseBinding@1 and KitTrustedComputingBaseBinding@1 consume the Accelerate inventory without reminting pack, current-root, chain, objective, protocol, client, parity, bypass, or threat-model identities. Audit package remains PCPR-092. Closed release decision remains PCPR-093/094. Live Supervisor.run, live Quack, live MCP, and live CLI stay typed unavailable. Missing a live Quack-fenced session emits operator-blocking task pcpr-091-operator-live-tcb-inventory. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
